    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86525" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προανα-κρίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>examine beforehand,</i> of measures to be submitted
